  "audit_source": "import BusyBeaver.ZFC.DuplicateProfiles\n\nopen SetTheory SetTheory.BusyBeaver.ZFC\n\n#print axioms DuplicateProfiles.project_scons\n#print axioms DuplicateProfiles.sat_duplicate\n#print axioms DuplicateProfiles.irreflexive_duplicate\n#print axioms DuplicateProfiles.models_duplicate\n#print axioms DuplicateProfiles.outgoing_twins\n#print axioms DuplicateProfiles.no_native_singleton\n#print axioms DuplicateProfiles.singleton_of_point_collection\n#print axioms DuplicateProfiles.point_collection_of_form\n#print axioms DuplicateProfiles.duplicate_not_point_gic\n#print axioms DuplicateProfiles.point_code\n#print axioms DuplicateProfiles.singletonCarrier_mem\n#print axioms DuplicateProfiles.singleton_of_namedG\n#print axioms DuplicateProfiles.singleton_of_encodable\n#print axioms DuplicateProfiles.duplicate_not_decoded\n#print axioms DuplicateProfiles.duplicate_obstruction\n\nexample {V : Type} (mem : V → V → Prop) (p : V)\n    (hirr : ∀ x, ¬ mem x x) (h : ProfileModel.ModelsCPGIC mem)\n    (reverse : ∀ (D : Type) (r : D → D → Prop), (Nat → D) →\n      (∀ x, ¬ r x x) → ProfileModel.ModelsCPGIC r → Code254Models.ModelsDecoded r) : False :=\n  DuplicateProfiles.duplicate_not_decoded mem p hirr h\n    (reverse (V × Bool) (DuplicateProfiles.duplicateMem mem) (fun _ => (p, false))\n      (DuplicateProfiles.irreflexive_duplicate mem hirr) (DuplicateProfiles.models_duplicate mem h))\n\nexample {V : Type} (mem : V → V → Prop) (p : V)\n    (h : ProfileModel.ModelsCPGIC mem) :\n    ¬ Sat (DuplicateProfiles.duplicateMem mem) (fun _ => (p, false))\n      (ProfileSyntax.gicForm (.fEq 1 2)) :=\n  DuplicateProfiles.duplicate_not_point_gic mem p h\n\nexample {V : Type} (mem : V → V → Prop) (p : V) :\n    Sat mem (fun _ => p) (.fEq 0 1) ∧\n      ¬ Sat (DuplicateProfiles.duplicateMem mem)\n        (fun n => if n = 0 then (p, false) else (p, true)) (.fEq 0 1) := by\n  constructor\n  · rfl\n  · intro h\n    have heq := congrArg Prod.snd h\n    cases heq\n",
